# Guest artifacts are produced by build-guest.sh, not committed: the ELF is a
# binary (breaks text-based CI tooling) and the pack helper is copied from the
# pinned commit at build time. PINNED_COMMIT (text) is tracked.
guest/runtime_dispatcher.elf
guest/pack-bytecode.py
guest/*.bak
*.bak
__pycache__/
*.pyc
